.\" Man page for kinyarwanda_nlp
.\" Run with: man ./man/kinyarwanda_nlp.1
.TH KINYARWANDA_NLP 1 "2026" "v1.2.0" "Kinyarwanda NLP Engine"
.SH IZINA / NAME
kinyarwanda_nlp \- Imashini isesengura Ikinyarwanda (Kinyarwanda NLP engine)
.SH INCAMAKE / SYNOPSIS
.B kinyarwanda_nlp
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B kinyarwanda_nlp
\fB\-s\fR \fI"interuro"\fR
.br
.B kinyarwanda_nlp
\fB\-f\fR \fIdosiye.txt\fR
.br
.B kinyarwanda_nlp
\fB\-p\fR \fIdosiye.pdf\fR
.SH IBISOBANURO / DESCRIPTION
.B kinyarwanda_nlp
ni imashini isesengura indimi ikoreshwa mu Kinyarwanda.
Isesengura interuro kandi yerekana:
.IP \(bu 4
Ubwoko bw'amagambo (POS tagging): izina, ntera, inshinga, ikinyazina, ...
.IP \(bu 4
Inteko y'izina (noun class Nt.1\-Nt.16)
.IP \(bu 4
Ibihe by'inshinga (verb tense): Indagihe, Impitagihe (Impitakere/Impitakera), Inzagihe, Isabira
.IP \(bu 4
Amakosa mu gushyira amagambo hamwe (agreement errors)
.IP \(bu 4
Ibitekerezo byo gusubiza (correction suggestions)
.PP
Inzego z'ubumenyi zikoreshwa ni iza mu gitabo:
.I "Ikinyarwanda Amashuri Nderabarezi (TTC) \- REB 2020"
hamwe na corpus ya
.I "Bibiliya Yera 2001"
(Bible Society of Rwanda).
.SH IBIRANGO / OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-s \ \fI"interuro"\fR
Sesengura interuro imwe yo ku murongo w'itegeko.
Analyze a single sentence given on the command line.
.br
Urugero: \fBkinyarwanda_nlp \-s "Umuntu munini aragenda"\fR
.TP
.BR \-f \ \fIdosiye.txt\fR
Sesengura dosiye ya .txt. Buri murongo usesengurwa nk'interuro imwe.
Analyze a plain text file, one sentence per line.
.br
Urugero: \fBkinyarwanda_nlp \-f inkuru.txt\fR
.TP
.BR \-p \ \fIdosiye.pdf\fR
Hindura dosiye ya PDF ibe iy'inyandiko hanyuma usesengure (bisaba
.BR pdftotext ,
igice cya
.I poppler-utils
).
Convert a PDF to text using
.B pdftotext
and analyse it.
.br
Urugero: \fBkinyarwanda_nlp \-p Bibiliya.pdf\fR
.br
Shyiraho: \fBsudo apt install poppler-utils\fR
.TP
.B \-v
Werekana ibisobanuro by'inizi (verbose mode).
Show detailed output including pronoun subtypes and more token info.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Werekana urupapuro rw'ubufasha (show this help).
.TP
.B \-\-version
Werekana verisiyo y'imashini (show engine version and corpus info).
.SH IBISOBANURO BY'IBIBONEKA / OUTPUT FORMAT
Buri gahunda yerekana imbonerahamwe ifite inkingi enye:
.PP
.RS
.nf
Ijambo/Word    Ubwoko/Type              Inteko/Class  Igicumbi/Stem
\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-
Umuntu         Izina mbonera (Noun)     Nt.1          nt
munini         Ntera (Adjective)        Nt.1          nini
aragenda       Inshinga\-conjugated      Nt.1          gend
  \[u2514]\[u2500] Indagihe y'ako kanya (Present \- immediate)
.fi
.RE
.PP
Agace k'ikosa \fB!\fR kabanziriza ijambo rifite ikosa ry'ingengabitekerezo.
An error marker \fB!\fR precedes any word with a detected agreement error.
.PP
Ibihe by'inshinga (tense labels) ziboneka munsi y'inshinga ikonjugeshwa (REB 2020):
.RS
.IP \fBIndagihe\ y'ako\ kanya\fR 36
Present immediate (SP+ra+stem+a): \fIaragenda\fR, \fIiravuga\fR
.IP \fBIndagihe\ y'ubusanzwe\fR 36
Habitual present (SP+stem+a): \fIibona\fR, \fIbarima\fR
.IP \fBImpitakere\fR 36
Recent past \- Impitagihe (SP+stem+ye): \fIyaremye\fR, \fIbagiye\fR
.IP \fBImpitakera\fR 36
Remote/habitual past \- Impitagihe (SP+stem+aga): \fIyagendaga\fR
.IP \fBInzagihe\fR 36
Future (SP+za+stem+a): \fIazagenda\fR, \fItuzakora\fR
.IP \fBIsabira\fR 36
Subjunctive/Conditional (SP+stem+e): \fIagende\fR, \fIakore\fR
.IP \fBInshinga\ y'imigani\fR 36
Narrative consecutive (SP+ka+stem+a): \fIakagenda\fR
.RE
.SH AMAKOSA ASESENGURWA / ERRORS DETECTED
.TP
.B ERR_ADJ_AGREEMENT
Ntera ntishyikiye inteko y'izina iranga.
The adjective concordance prefix does not match the noun class.
.br
Urugero: \fBumuntu binini\fR (nt.1 noun, nt.8 adjective) → should be \fBmunini\fR
.TP
.B ERR_POSS_AGREEMENT
Ikinyazina ngenera ntishyikiye inteko y'izina.
The possessive connector does not agree with the noun class.
.br
Urugero: \fBurugo wacu\fR (nt.11 noun, nt.1 possessive) → should be \fBrwacu\fR
.TP
.B ERR_NO_VERB
Interuro ntagira inshinga. A complete sentence requires at least one verb.
.TP
.B ERR_UNKNOWN_WORD
Ijambo ntiriziwe mu Kinyarwanda (unrecognised word, possibly foreign).
.SH INGERO / EXAMPLES
.TP
Sesengura interuro imwe (analyse one sentence):
.nf
\fBkinyarwanda_nlp \-s "Imana yaremye ijuru n'isi"\fR
.fi
.TP
Sesengura ufite ibisobanuro by'inizi (verbose):
.nf
\fBkinyarwanda_nlp \-v \-s "Urugo rwacu rurabaho"\fR
.fi
.TP
Sesengura dosiye ya .txt:
.nf
\fBkinyarwanda_nlp \-f inkuru.txt\fR
.fi
.TP
Sesengura dosiye ya PDF:
.nf
\fBkinyarwanda_nlp \-p Bibiliya.pdf\fR
.fi
.TP
Uburyo bw'ikiganiro (interactive mode):
.nf
\fBkinyarwanda_nlp\fR
>>> Umuntu munini aragenda
>>> help
>>> quit
.fi
.SH INTEKO Z'AMAZINA / NOUN CLASSES
Ikinyarwanda gifite inteko z'amazina 16 (16 noun classes):
.RS
.nf
Nt.1   umu\-   Human singular    umuntu (person)
Nt.2   aba\-   Human plural      abantu (people)
Nt.3   umu\-   Tree/thing sg.    umuti (tree)
Nt.4   imi\-   Tree/thing pl.    imiti (trees)
Nt.5   i\-     Singular          ibuye (stone)
Nt.6   ama\-   Plural/mass       amabuye (stones)
Nt.7   iki\-   Thing singular    ikitabo (book)
Nt.8   ibi\-   Thing plural      ibitabo (books)
Nt.9   in\-    Animal/thing sg.  inka (cow)
Nt.10  in\-    Animal/thing pl.  inka (cows)
Nt.11  uru\-   Long/thin things  urugo (home)
Nt.12  aka\-   Diminutive sg.    akana (small child)
Nt.13  utu\-   Diminutive pl.    utugabo (little men)
Nt.14  ubu\-   Abstract nouns    uburezi (education)
Nt.15  uku\-   Infinitives       ukugenda (going)
Nt.16  aha\-   Locatives         ahantu (place)
.fi
.RE
.SH DOSIYE / FILES
.TP
.I /usr/local/bin/kinyarwanda_nlp
Binary executable (after sudo make install)
.TP
.I /usr/local/man/man1/kinyarwanda_nlp.1
This man page (after sudo make install)
